  "title": {
   "en": "On Your Knees, Your Grace!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "꿇어보세요, 대공님!"
   },
   {
    "en": "Head Down, Your Grace!"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Everyone has had the urge to punch their infuriating boss, but actually going through with it is hard. Especially when that boss is a war hero and a grand duke, no less. Chloe could only grit her teeth as she watched Curtis constantly conduct service inspections… but then, a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity presented itself. The king ordered Curtis to marry a noblewoman from another country, and he put forward his lieutenant, Chloe, as his lover. Now, the gun was in her hands… “First, get on your knees, Your Grace.”"
  },
